<title>NETHERLANDS: Fortis Q1 results in detail.</title>
<headline>Fortis Q1 results in detail.</headline>
<dateline>UTRECHT, Netherlands 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q1 1997</p>
<p>(millions of ECUs unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>FORTIS GROUP --</p>
<p>INSURANCE</p>
<p>	-- Life operating profit	    93  vs   82</p>
<p>	-- Non-life operating profit	17  vs   13</p>
<p>	-- Other operating profits	  57  vs   45</p>
<p>	-- Total operating profit	  167  vs  140</p>
<p>	-- Capital gains			37  vs   34</p>
<p>	-- Exceptional charges		14  vs   12</p>
<p>BANKING</p>
<p>     -- Net interest income		425  vs  388</p>
<p>     -- Net commission income	    127  vs   44</p>
<p>     -- Other income			 123  vs   74</p>
<p>     -- Charges				495  vs  388</p>
<p>     -- Operating profit		   180  vs  118</p>
<p>    Unallocated costs			 26  vs   15</p>
<p>    Tax					   92  vs   67</p>
<p>    Group profit			     252  vs  198</p>
<p>    Third-party interests		   48  vs   41</p>
<p>    Net profit				 204  vs  157</p>
<p>NOTE - Fortis is a banking and insurance group jointly owned by Fortis AG of Belgium and Fortis AMEV of the Netherlands.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
